msgid "Leaflet lightweight WebGIS front-end class library"
msgstr "LEAFLE轻量级WebGIS前端类库"

msgid ""
"Leaflet is a modern, open source JavaScript library developed to build a "
"mobile device-friendly interactive map. It was developed by a team of "
"professional contributors led by Vladimir Agafonkin. It has a small amount "
"of code, but has most of the functions that developers can do to develop "
"online maps. Leaflet design adheres to the idea of simplicity, high "
"performance and good availability, works efficiently on all major desktop "
"and mobile platforms, takes advantage of HTML5 and CSS3 in modern browsers, "
"and also supports access to older browsers. Support for plug-in extensions, "
"with a friendly, easy-to-use API documentation and a simple, readable source"
" code."
msgstr ""
"LEAFLE是一个现代的、开源的JavaScript库，用于构建移动设备友好的交互式地图。它是由弗拉基米尔·阿加方金领导的一个专业贡献者团队开发的。它有少量的代码，但拥有开发人员开发在线地图所能完成的大部分功能。LEAFLE设计秉承简单、高性能和高可用性的理念，在所有主要桌面和移动平台上高效工作，利用现代浏览器中的HTML5和CSS3，还支持访问较旧的浏览器。支持插件扩展，具有友好、易用的API文档和简单易读的源代码。"

msgid "Introduction to Leaflet"
msgstr "宣传单简介"

msgid ""
"Leaflet is an open source JavaScript library for mobile rendering of "
"interactive maps. Its design philosophy is efficient, lightweight and "
"practical. It is only about 38KB in size, but it has the map manipulation "
"capabilities that most developers need and can work on common desktop and "
"mobile platforms. Has an extensible plug-in system, clear and readable code,"
" and elegance documentation and easy-to-operate API."
msgstr ""
"Leavlet是一个开放源码的JavaScript库，用于移动渲染交互式地图。它的设计理念是高效、轻便和实用。它的大小只有38KB左右，但它拥有大多数开发人员需要的地图操作功能，可以在常见的桌面和移动平台上运行。具有可扩展的插件系统、清晰易读的代码、优雅的文档和易于操作的API。"

msgid "Brief introduction"
msgstr "简介"

msgid ""
"Leaflet is a modern, open source JavaScript library developed to build "
"interactive maps for mobile devices. The code is only 33 KB, but it has most"
" of the functions of developing online maps. Leaflet design adheres to the "
"philosophy of simplicity, high performance and good usability. It works "
"efficiently on all major desktop and mobile platforms, taking advantage of "
"HTML5 and CSS3 in modern browsers, while also supporting access to older "
"browsers. Support for plug-in extensions, with a friendly, easy-to-use API "
"documentation and a simple, readable source code. Leaflet’s powerful open "
"source library plug-in involves all aspects of map applications, including "
"map services. There are more than 140 plug-ins for data provision, data "
"format, geocoding, route and route search, map controls and interactions. "
"These controls enrich the functions of leaflet, at the same time, it is very"
" convenient to implement custom controls with good expansibility."
msgstr ""
"LEAFLE是一个现代的、开源的JavaScript库，旨在为移动设备构建交互式地图。代码只有33KB，但它具有开发在线地图的大部分功能。传单设计秉承简约、高性能、好用的设计理念。它在所有主要的桌面和移动平台上高效工作，利用现代浏览器中的HTML5和CSS3，同时还支持访问较旧的浏览器。支持插件扩展，具有友好、易用的API文档和简单易读的源代码。Leavlet强大的开源库插件涉及地图应用程序的方方面面，包括地图服务。有140多个插件，用于数据提供、数据格式、地理编码、路线和路线搜索、地图控制和交互。这些控件丰富了Leaflet的功能，同时实现自定义控件非常方便，具有良好的可扩展性。"

msgid "Leaflet getting started Guid"
msgstr "小册子入门指南"

msgid ""
"This step-by-step guide gives you a quick understanding of the basics of "
"leaflet, including building leaflet maps, using tags, multilines and pop-up "
"windows, and handling events."
msgstr "本分步指南让您快速了解传单的基本知识，包括构建传单地图、使用标记、多行和弹出窗口以及处理事件。"

msgid "Prepare the page"
msgstr "准备页面"

msgid ""
"Before you write the map code, you need to do the following on the page:"
msgstr "在编写地图代码之前，您需要在页面上执行以下操作："

msgid ""
"On the page ``<head>`` Label vs. ``</head>`` Add the following code between "
"the tags:"
msgstr "在页面上  ``<head>`` 标签与  ``</head>`` 在标记之间添加以下代码："

msgid "Create a map where you want to create a map with a ``id`` Of ``div`` ."
msgstr "创建要在其中创建地图的地图  ``id`` 的  ``div`` 。"

msgid "Make sure the map has a clear height, such as defined in CSS:"
msgstr "确保地图具有清晰的高度，如在css中定义的那样："

msgid ""
"Now that the map has been initialized, you are ready to do something with "
"it."
msgstr "既然已经初始化了映射，您就可以对其执行一些操作了。"

msgid "Create a map"
msgstr "创建地图"

msgid ""
"1.Initialize the map and set its view to the geographic coordinates and zoom"
" level we selected："
msgstr "1.初始化地图，并将其视图设置为我们选择的地理坐标和缩放级别："

msgid ""
"By default (because we didn’t set any parameters when we created the map "
"instance), all mouse events and touch interactions on the map are turned on,"
" and it has zoom and property controls."
msgstr "默认情况下(因为我们在创建地图实例时没有设置任何参数)，地图上的所有鼠标事件和触摸交互都是打开的，并且它具有缩放和属性控件。"

msgid "Show the map:"
msgstr "显示地图："

msgid ""
"Make sure that all the code is used to display the map ``div`` And "
"``leaflet.js`` Called after containing."
msgstr "确保所有代码都用于显示地图  ``div`` 和  ``leaflet.js`` 在包含后调用。"

msgid "Dot mark, circle mark, and polygon mark"
msgstr "点标记、圆标记和多边形标记"

msgid ""
"In addition to tiles, you can easily add other things to your map, including"
" markers, broken lines, polygons, circles and pop-ups. Let’s add a tag:"
msgstr "除了瓷砖，您还可以轻松地向地图添加其他内容，包括标记、虚线、多边形、圆和弹出窗口。让我们添加一个标记："

msgid "Add a circle tag:"
msgstr "添加圆形标记："

msgid "Adding polygon tags is equally simple:"
msgstr "添加多边形标签也同样简单："

msgid "Use pop-up window"
msgstr "使用弹出窗口"

msgid ""
"Pop-up windows are usually used to attach some information to specific "
"objects on a map. Leaflet has a very simple way to do this:"
msgstr "弹出窗口通常用于将某些信息附加到地图上的特定对象。Lamlet有一个非常简单的方法来做到这一点："

msgid ""
"Try to click on our object. The bindPopup method appends a pop-up window "
"with the specified HTML content to the tag, so when you click an object, the"
" pop-up window appears, and the openPopup method (for markup only) "
"immediately opens the attached pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"尝试点击我们的对象。BindPopup方法将具有指定HTML内容的弹出窗口附加到标签，因此当您单击对象时，将显示弹出窗口，并且OpenPopup方法(仅用于标记)会立即打开附加的弹出窗口。"

msgid ""
"You can also set the pop-up window as a layer (when you need more instead of"
" attaching a pop-up window to an object):"
msgstr "您还可以将弹出窗口设置为层(当您需要更多层时，而不是将弹出窗口附加到对象)："

msgid ""
"Here we use ``openOn`` Instead of ``addTo`` Because it handles the automatic"
" closure of previously opened pop-up windows when it opens a new pop-up "
"window, which enhances usability."
msgstr ""
"在这里我们使用  ``openOn`` 而不是  ``addTo`` "
"因为当它打开一个新的弹出窗口时，它处理以前打开的弹出窗口的自动关闭，这增强了可用性。"

msgid "Deal with events"
msgstr "处理事件"

msgid ""
"Every time something happens in Leaflet, such as when a user clicks a marker"
" or a map zoom change, the corresponding object sends an event that you can "
"handle through a function that allows you to react to user interaction:"
msgstr ""
"每次传单中发生一些事情，例如当用户单击标记或地图缩放更改时，相应的对象都会发送一个事件，您可以通过允许您对用户交互做出反应的函数来处理该事件："

msgid ""
"Each object has its own set of events, and the first parameter of the "
"listener function is the event object, which contains useful information "
"about the events that occur. For example, the MAP click event object (e in "
"the example above) has the latlng property, and the latlng property is where"
" the click occurs."
msgstr ""
"每个对象都有自己的一组事件，侦听器函数的第一个参数是Event对象，它包含有关发生的事件的有用信息。例如，地图单击事件对象(上例中的e)具有latlng属性，而latlng属性是发生单击的位置。"

msgid "Let’s improve our example by using pop-ups instead of alert:"
msgstr "让我们通过使用弹出窗口而不是警报来改进我们的示例："

msgid ""
"Try clicking on the map and you will see the coordinates in the pop-up "
"window. Check out the complete example:"
msgstr "试着点击地图，你会在弹出窗口中看到坐标。查看完整的示例："

msgid "Custom callout icon"
msgstr "自定义详图索引图标"

msgid ""
"In this tutorial, you’ll learn how to easily tag a map with a custom icon."
msgstr "在本教程中，您将学习如何轻松地使用自定义图标标记地图。"

msgid "Preparing images"
msgstr "准备图像"

msgid ""
"In order to make a custom icon, we usually need two images - the actual icon"
" image and its shadow image. For this tutorial, we used the Leaflet logo and"
" created 4 images - 3 different color blade images and a common shadow image"
" for them:"
msgstr ""
"为了制作一个自定义图标，我们通常需要两个图像--"
"实际的图标图像和它的阴影图像。在本教程中，我们使用了传单徽标并创建了4个图像-3个不同颜色的刀片图像和一个常见的阴影图像："

msgid "Note that the white areas in the image are actually transparent."
msgstr "请注意，图像中的白色区域实际上是透明的。"

msgid "Create icon"
msgstr "创建图标"

msgid ""
"The marker icon in the Leaflet is defined by the ``L.Icon`` object and is "
"used as a parameter option when creating the marker. Let’s create a green "
"leaf icon:"
msgstr "传单中的标记图标由  ``L.Icon`` 对象，并在创建标记时用作参数选项。让我们创建一个绿叶图标："

msgid "Now it’s easy to put an icon on the map:"
msgstr "现在很容易在地图上放置一个图标："

msgid "Define icon class"
msgstr "定义图标类"

msgid ""
"What if we need to create some icons that have a lot in common? Let’s define"
" our own icon class, which includes sharing options. It’s really easy to "
"inherit Leaflet from the L icon (　``L.Icon``　):"
msgstr ""
"如果我们需要创建一些有很多共同点的图标怎么办？让我们定义我们自己的图标类，它包括共享选项。从L偶像身上继承传单真的很容易( 　``L.Icon`` )："

msgid "Now we can create these three leaf icons in this class and use them:"
msgstr "现在我们可以在这个类中创建这三个树叶图标并使用它们："

msgid ""
"As you may have noticed, we created a leaf icon instance using the keyword "
"``new``. So why aren’t all Leaflet classes created with it? The answer is "
"simple: the real Leaflet classes are named with uppercase letters (such as "
"L.Icon), and they also need to use ``new`` is created, but it is also named "
"with a lowercase letter name (L.icon), which is created for convenience, "
"such as:"
msgstr ""
"正如您可能已经注意到的，我们使用关键字  ``new`` "
"。那么，为什么不是所有的传单课程都是用它创建的呢？答案很简单：真正的LEAFLE类使用大写字母命名(如L.Icon)，并且它们还需要使用  "
"``new`` 是创建的，但它的名称也是用小写字母名称(L.icon)命名的，创建该名称是为了方便，例如："

msgid ""
"You can also do the same thing in class. OK, let’s put the markers for these"
" icons on the map:"
msgstr "你也可以在课堂上做同样的事情。好的，让我们把这些图标的标记放在地图上："

msgid "Now open the full example ."
msgstr "现在打开完整的示例。"

msgid "Use GeoJSON and Leaflet"
msgstr "使用GeoJSON和LEAFLE"

msgid ""
"GeoJSON is very simple, lightweight, and straightforward. It is becoming a "
"very popular data format for many GIS technologies and services. Leaflet is "
"very good at dealing with GeoJSON. In this case, you’ll learn how to create "
"and interact with a map vector in a GeoJSON object."
msgstr ""
"GeoJSON非常简单、轻量级、直截了当。它正在成为许多地理信息系统技术和服务的一种非常流行的数据格式。LEAFLE非常擅长处理GeoJSON。在本例中，您将学习如何在GeoJSON对象中创建地图矢量并与之交互。"

msgid "Introduction of GeoJSON"
msgstr "GeoJSON简介"

msgid ""
"According to the GeJJSON specification (RFC 7946): GeoJSON is a format for "
"encoding various geographic data structures. GeoJSON objects can represent "
"geometry, features, or feature sets. GeoJSON supports the following geometry"
" types: point, line, polygon, multipoint, multiline, polygon, and geometry. "
"Features in GeoJSON contain a geometric object and other properties, and a "
"feature set represents a series of features."
msgstr ""
"根据GeJJSON规范(RFC "
"7946)：GeoJSON是一种用于编码各种地理数据结构的格式。GeoJSON对象可以表示几何图形、要素或要素集。GeoJSON支持以下几何图形类型：点、直线、多边形、多点、多线、多边形和几何图形。GeoJSON中的要素包含几何对象和其他特性，要素集表示一系列要素。"

msgid ""
"Leaflet supports all of the above GeoJSON types, but features and feature "
"sets perform best because they allow you to describe features with a set of "
"attributes. We can even use these properties to design our Leaflet vector. "
"Here’s an example of a simple GeoJSON feature:"
msgstr ""
"LEAFLE支持上述所有GeoJSON类型，但功能和功能集执行得最好，因为它们允许您使用一组属性来描述功能。我们甚至可以使用这些属性来设计我们的传单矢量。以下是一个简单的GeoJSON功能的示例："

msgid "GeoJSON Layer"
msgstr "GeoJSON层"

msgid ""
"GeoJSON objects are added to the map via the GeoJSON layer. To create it and"
" add it to the map, we can use the following code:"
msgstr "GeoJSON对象通过GeoJSON层添加到地图。要创建它并将其添加到地图，我们可以使用以下代码："

msgid "GeoJSON objects can also be passed as arrays of valid GeoJSON objects."
msgstr "GeoJSON对象也可以作为有效的GeoJSON对象的数组传递。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, we can create an empty GeoJSON layer and assign it to a "
"variable so that we can add more features later."
msgstr "或者，我们可以创建一个空的GeoJSON层并将其赋给一个变量，以便我们可以在以后添加更多的要素。"

msgid "``style`` options"
msgstr "``style`` 选项"

msgid ""
"The ``style`` option can be used to style in two different ways. First, we "
"can set the style of all paths (polylines and polygons) in the same way "
"through a simple object:"
msgstr ""
"这个  ``style`` 选项可用于以两种不同的方式设置样式。首先，我们可以通过一个简单的对象以相同的方式设置所有路径(折线和多边形)的样式："

msgid ""
"Or, we can use functions to set the style of their various properties. In "
"the following example, we check the “party” attribute and set our polygon "
"style accordingly:"
msgstr "或者，我们可以使用函数来设置其各种属性的样式。在下面的示例中，我们检查“party”属性并相应地设置我们的多边形样式："

msgid "Point Layer（ ``pointToLayer`` ）"
msgstr "点图层(  ``pointToLayer`` )"

msgid ""
"Points are treated differently than polylines and polygons. By default, "
"simple tags are drawn for GeoJSON points. When creating a GeoJSON coating, "
"we can change this by passing a function in the GeoJSON option object with "
"``pointToLayer``. This function passes a ``LatLng`` and returns an instance "
"of ``ILayer``, which in this case might be ``Marker`` or ``CircleMarker``."
msgstr ""
"点的处理方式与多段线和多边形不同。默认情况下，为GeoJSON点绘制简单标记。创建GeoJSON涂层时，我们可以通过在GeoJSON选项对象中传递一个函数来更改此设置"
"  ``pointToLayer`` 。此函数将一个  ``LatLng`` 并返回  ``ILayer`` ，在本例中可能是  ``Marker`` "
"或  ``CircleMarker`` 。"

msgid "We can also create a circular tag using the ``pointToLayer`` option:"
msgstr "我们还可以使用  ``pointToLayer`` 选项："

msgid ""
"We can also set the ``style`` of the property in this example - If you "
"create a circle-like vector layer inside the pointToLayer function, the "
"Leaflet is smart enough to apply the style to the GeoJSON point ( "
"``pointToLayer`` )."
msgstr ""
"我们还可以设置  ``style`` 如果在point ToLayer函数内创建一个圆形向量层，则小叶足够智能，可以将样式应用于GeoJSON点(  "
"``pointToLayer`` )。"

msgid "onEachFeature"
msgstr "On EachFeature"

msgid ""
"The ``onEachFeature`` option is a feature that is called before each feature"
" is added to the GeoJSON layer. This option is usually used to attach pop-"
"ups when clicking on a feature."
msgstr ""
"这个  ``onEachFeature`` 选项是在将每个要素添加到GeoJSON层之前调用的要素。此选项通常用于在单击要素时附加弹出窗口。"

msgid "Filter（ ``filter`` ）"
msgstr "过滤器(  ``filter`` )"

msgid ""
"This filter option can be used to control the visibility of GeoJSON "
"functionality. To do this, we set the filter option through a function. This"
" function is called by each element in the GeoJSON layer and passes the "
"feature and layer. You can then use the value in this property to control "
"the visibility false by returning true or."
msgstr ""
"此筛选器选项可用于控制GeoJSON功能的可见性。为此，我们通过一个函数设置过滤器选项。此函数由GeoJSON层中的每个元素调用，并传递要素和层。然后，可以使用此属性中的值通过返回True或来控制可见性False。"

msgid "In the example below, “Busch Field” will not be displayed on the map."
msgstr "在下面的例子中，“Busch field”将不会显示在地图上。"

msgid "Interactive Choropleth Map"
msgstr "交互式合唱地图"

msgid ""
"This is a case study that, with the help of GeoJSON and some custom "
"controls, creates a color interactive US state population density map."
msgstr "这是一个案例研究，在GeoJSON和一些自定义控件的帮助下，创建了一个彩色交互的美国州人口密度地图。"

msgid "Data source"
msgstr "数据源"

msgid ""
"We visualize data on US population density. Since the amount of data is not "
"very large, the easiest way to store and display data is GeoJSON."
msgstr "我们将美国人口密度的数据可视化。由于数据量不是很大，存储和显示数据的最简单方式是GeoJSON。"

msgid "Each feature of our GeoJSON data will look like this:"
msgstr "我们的GeoJSON数据的每个功能如下所示："

msgid "Basic states diagram"
msgstr "基本状态图"

msgid "Let’s display our states data on the map in a custom Mapbox style."
msgstr "让我们以定制的MapBox样式在地图上显示我们的州数据。"

msgid "Adding colors"
msgstr "添加颜色"

msgid ""
"Now we need to color the states based on population density. Choosing good "
"colors for your map may require a bit of skill, but there is a great tool to"
" help us – ColorBrewer. We create a function that returns the population "
"based density based on the values obtained from ColorBrewer:"
msgstr ""
"现在我们需要根据人口密度给这些州上色。为你的地图选择好的颜色可能需要一些技巧，但有一个很好的工具可以帮助我们-"
"ColorBreyer。我们创建一个函数，该函数根据从ColorBreyer获得的值返回基于人口的密度："

msgid ""
"Next, we define the style function of the GeoJSON layer so that its ``fill "
"color`` depends on ``feature.properties.density`` . At the same time, we "
"also adjusted the appearance and added beautiful strokes."
msgstr ""
"接下来，我们定义GeoJSON层的样式函数，以便其  ``fill color`` 取决于  "
"``feature.properties.density`` 。同时，我们还调整了外观，增加了优美的笔触。"

msgid "It looks much better now!"
msgstr "现在看起来好多了！"

msgid "Adding Interaction"
msgstr "添加交互组件"

msgid ""
"Now let’s make the color block highlight when we pass the mouse over the "
"color patches on the map that represent the states of the United States. "
"First, we’ll define an event listener for the layer’s mouse events:"
msgstr "现在，当我们将鼠标移到地图上代表美国各州的色块上时，让颜色块突出显示。首先，我们将为层的鼠标事件定义一个事件侦听器："

msgid ""
"Here we pass ``e.target`` Get the mouseover layer and set a wide gray border"
" on this layer as our highlight, while placing the layer on the top layer, "
"This way the border will not conflict with the nearby state (instead of IE, "
"Opera or Edge)."
msgstr ""
"我们在这里通过  ``e.target`` "
"将鼠标悬停在层上，并在该层上设置一个宽大的灰色边框作为我们的高亮显示，同时将该层放在最上面的层上，这样边框就不会与附近的状态(而不是IE、Opera或Edge)冲突。"

msgid "Next, we’ll define what happens to ``mouseout``:"
msgstr "接下来，我们将定义  ``mouseout`` ："

msgid ""
"The convenient geojson.resetStyle method will reset the layer’s style to the"
" default state (defined by our ``style`` function). To do this, make sure "
"our GeoJSON layer can be defined by the previous listener ``geojson`` "
"variable access, then assign this GeoJSON layer to ``geojson`` variable:"
msgstr ""
"使用方便的Geojson.setStyle方法可以将图层的样式重置为默认状态(由  ``style`` "
"功能)。要执行此操作，请确保之前的监听程序可以定义我们的GeoJSON图层  ``geojson`` 变量访问权限，然后将此GeoJSON图层分配给  "
"``geojson`` 变量："

msgid "Let’s define a click listener to zoom in on the state:"
msgstr "让我们定义一个点击监听程序来放大状态："

msgid ""
"Now we will use the ``onEachFeature`` option to add listeners to the layers "
"in which the states are located:"
msgstr "现在我们将使用  ``onEachFeature`` 用于将监听程序添加到州所在层的选项："

msgid ""
"This makes the state on the map stand out when the mouse passes, and gives "
"us the ability to add other interactive features to the listener."
msgstr "这使地图上的状态在鼠标经过时变得突出，并使我们能够向监听器添加其他交互功能。"

msgid "Custom information control"
msgstr "自定义信息控件"

msgid ""
"Usually we use pop-ups to display information, but we now use a different "
"method - displaying information in a custom control when hovering over it."
msgstr "通常我们使用弹出窗口来显示信息，但现在我们使用一种不同的方法-将鼠标悬停在自定义控件上时在该控件中显示信息。"

msgid "Here is our control code:"
msgstr "以下是我们的控制代码："

msgid ""
"When the user mouses over a certain state, we need to update the controls, "
"so we modify the listener as follows:"
msgstr "当用户将鼠标悬停在某个状态上时，我们需要更新控件，因此我们按如下方式修改监听器："

msgid "The control needs some CSS style to make it look good:"
msgstr "该控件需要一些css样式才能使其看起来很好："

msgid "Custom legend control"
msgstr "自定义图例控件"

msgid ""
"It’s easier to create a control with a legend because it’s static and won’t "
"change when the state is hovered. JavaScript code:"
msgstr "创建带有图例的控件更容易，因为它是静态的，并且在状态悬停时不会更改。JavaScript代码："

msgid ""
"The CSS style of the control (we also reuse the previously defined ``info`` "
"class):"
msgstr "控件的css样式(我们还重用了先前定义的  ``info`` 类)："

msgid ""
"Enjoy <a href=\"./choropleth.html\">results</a> at the top of this page, or "
"on a separate page."
msgstr "请在此页面顶部或在单独的页面上享受<a href=“./clopple.html”>结果</a>。"

msgid "Layer group and layer control"
msgstr "图层组和图层控件"

msgid ""
"This tutorial shows you how to combine multiple layers into a set of layers "
"and how to use layer controls to allow users to easily switch between "
"different layers on the map."
msgstr "本教程将向您展示如何将多个层组合成一组层，以及如何使用层控件来允许用户在地图上的不同层之间轻松切换。"

msgid "Layer group"
msgstr "图层组"

msgid ""
"Suppose you have a bunch of layers, and you want to combine them in your "
"code to handle them:"
msgstr "假设您有一组层，并且希望在代码中组合它们以处理它们："

msgid ""
"Instead of adding them directly to the map, you can use the LayerGroup class"
" to do the following:"
msgstr "您可以使用LayerGroup类执行以下操作，而不是直接将它们添加到地图："

msgid ""
"Easy enough! Now you have a ``cities`` layer that merges your city logos "
"into one layer so you can add or remove them from the map right away."
msgstr "很简单！现在你有了一个  ``cities`` 将您的城市徽标合并到一个层中的层，以便您可以立即在地图中添加或删除它们。"

msgid "Layer control"
msgstr "层控制"

msgid ""
"Leaflet is a nice little control that allows users to control the layers "
"they see on the map. In addition to showing you how to use it, we’ll show "
"you another convenient use of layer groups."
msgstr "Leaflet是一个很好的小控件，允许用户控制他们在地图上看到的层。除了向您演示如何使用它之外，我们还将向您演示图层组的另一种方便用法。"

msgid "There are two types of layers:"
msgstr "有两种类型的层："

msgid ""
"mutually exclusive base layers (only one can be seen at a time on the map), "
"for example, tile layers, and"
msgstr "互斥的基础图层(一次只能在地图上看到一个)，例如切片图层和"

msgid "overlay layers, which are all placed on the base layer."
msgstr "覆盖所有放置在基础层上的层。"

msgid ""
"Other content. In this example, we want to have two base layers (grayscale "
"and color base maps) to switch, and an overlay layer (the city markers we "
"created earlier) to switch and close."
msgstr "其他内容。在本例中，我们希望切换两个基本层(灰度和颜色基本图)，以及切换和关闭一个覆盖层(我们先前创建的城市标记)。"

msgid "Now let’s create the base layer and add the default layer to the map:"
msgstr "现在，让我们创建基础层并将默认层添加到地图："

msgid ""
"Next, we create two objects. One contains our base layer and one contains "
"our overlay layer. These are just simple objects with key/value pairs. The "
"key sets the text of the layer in the control (for example “Streets”), and "
"the corresponding value is the opposite layer (for example, ``streets`` )."
msgstr ""
"接下来，我们创建两个对象。一个包含我们的基本层，一个包含我们的覆盖层。这些只是具有键/值对的简单对象。键设置控件中的层的文本(例如“Streets”)，对应的值是相反的层(例如，"
"  ``streets`` )。"

msgid ""
"Now, just create a layer control and add it to the map. The first parameter "
"passed when the layer control is created is the base layer object, and the "
"second parameter is the overlay object. Both of these parameters are "
"optional: when the second argument is omitted, you can only pass the base "
"layer object, or pass null as the first argument if you only want to pass "
"the overlay object. In either case, the omitted layer type will not appear "
"for the user to select."
msgstr ""
"现在，只需创建一个Layer控件并将其添加到地图中。创建Layer控件时传递的第一个参数是基本层对象，第二个参数是Overlay对象。这两个参数都是可选的：当省略第二个参数时，您只能传递基本层对象，或者如果您只想传递Overlay对象，则可以将NULL作为第一个参数传递。在任何一种情况下，省略的层类型都不会出现供用户选择。"

msgid ""
"Notice that we added the ``grayscale`` layer and ``cities`` layer, but no "
"``streets``. Layer control is smart enough to detect which layers we have "
"added and set the corresponding radio buttons and checkboxes."
msgstr ""
"请注意，我们添加了  ``grayscale`` 层和  ``cities`` 层，但没有  ``streets`` "
"。层控制足够智能，可以检测我们添加了哪些层，并设置相应的单选按钮和复选框。"

msgid ""
"Also note that when using multiple base layers, you only need to add one of "
"them to the map when instantiating, but all of these base layer objects "
"should exist when you create a layer control."
msgstr "还请注意，当使用多个基本层时，您只需要在实例化时将其中一个添加到地图中，但当您创建Layer控件时，所有这些基本层对象都应该存在。"

msgid ""
"Finally, when you define an object for a layer, you can define a style for "
"the object’s keys. For example, this code will make the grayscale map’s "
"labels gray:"
msgstr "最后，在为层定义对象时，可以为对象的键定义样式。例如，此代码将使灰度贴图的标签变为灰色："

msgid ""
"Now let’s take a separate page View results:  "
"./leaflet_layer_control/example.html"
msgstr "现在，让我们使用一个单独的页面查看结果：./leavlet_layer_control/example.html"

msgid "Zoom Level"
msgstr "缩放级别"

msgid "Leaflet uses latitude, longitude, and “zoom level.”"
msgstr "单张使用纬度、经度和“缩放级别”。"

msgid ""
"A lower zoom level means that the map shows the entire continent, while a "
"higher zoom level means that the map can display the details of the city."
msgstr "较低的缩放级别意味着地图显示整个大陆，而较高的缩放级别意味着地图可以显示城市的细节。"

msgid ""
"In order to understand how the zoom level works, we first need to make a "
"basic introduction to geodesy."
msgstr "为了了解变焦级别是如何工作的，我们首先需要对大地测量学做一个基本的介绍。"

msgid "Shape of the earth"
msgstr "地球的形状"

msgid "Let’s look at a simple map that is locked at level 0:"
msgstr "让我们来看一个锁定在级别0的简单地图："

msgid ""
"Please note that the “whole earth” is just a 256-pixel wide, 256-pixel "
"image:"
msgstr "请注意，整个地球只是一张256像素宽、256像素的图片："

msgid ""
"Be clear: the earth is not a square. More precisely, the shape of the earth "
"is like a strange potato, which can be approximated as something similar to "
"a sphere."
msgstr "要清楚：地球不是正方形的。更准确地说，地球的形状就像一个奇怪的土豆，可以近似为一个类似球体的东西。"

msgid ""
"So we assume that the earth is round. To make it flat, we put an imaginary "
"cylinder around it, unfold it, and then cut it to make it look square:"
msgstr "所以我们假设地球是圆的。为了使它变平，我们在它周围放置一个假想的圆柱体，展开它，然后将它切割成方形："

msgid ""
"There are hundreds of ways to display the Earth’s surface in a plane, each "
"with its advantages and disadvantages, which is just one of them."
msgstr "在平面上展示地球表面的方式有数百种，每种方式都有其优缺点，这只是其中之一。"

msgid "Now let’s **assume** the world is a square:"
msgstr "现在让我们 **assume** 世界是一个正方形："

msgid ""
"When the zoom level is 0, it represents the world, and its width and height "
"are both 256 pixels. When we move to the next zoom level, its width and "
"height are doubled and can be represented by four 256-pixel by 256-pixel "
"images:"
msgstr ""
"当缩放级别为0时，它表示世界，其宽度和高度都是256像素。当我们移动到下一个缩放级别时，它的宽度和高度增加了一倍，并且可以由四个256像素乘以256像素的图像来表示："

msgid ""
"At each zoom level, each tile is divided into four, the size (the length of "
"the edge given by the ``tileSize`` option) doubles, and the area is "
"increased by a factor of three."
msgstr "在每个缩放级别，每个平铺被分为四个，大小(边的长度由  ``tileSize`` 选项)翻了一番，面积增加了三倍。"

msgid "Notes on proportions"
msgstr "关于比例的注记"

msgid ""
"One of the disadvantages of using a cylindrical projection is that the scale"
" is not constant and the measurement distance or size is not reliable, "
"especially at low zoom levels."
msgstr "使用柱面投影的一个缺点是，比例不是恒定的，测量距离或大小不可靠，特别是在低变焦水平下。"

msgid ""
"Translate the equator to 60° north latitude by adding a ``L.Control.Scale`` "
"to the map. We can see how the scale factor is doubled. The following "
"example uses a JavaScript timeout to automate:"
msgstr ""
"将赤道平移到北纬60°，方法是  ``L.Control.Scale`` "
"到地图上。我们可以看到比例因子是如何加倍的。以下示例使用JavaScript超时自动执行以下操作："

msgid ""
"``L.Control.Scale`` displays the scales that apply to the center point of "
"the map. At relatively high zoom levels, the scale changes are not obvious."
msgstr "``L.Control.Scale`` 显示应用于地图中心点的比例。在相对较高的缩放级别下，比例变化不明显。"

msgid "Control zoom"
msgstr "控制缩放"

msgid ""
"A leaflet map has several ways to control the zoom level it displays, but "
"the most notable is ``setZoom()``. For example, map.setZoom(0) sets the zoom"
" level of ``map`` to ``0``."
msgstr ""
"单张地图有多种方法可以控制其显示的缩放级别，但最值得注意的是  ``setZoom()`` 。例如，map.setZoom(0)设置的缩放级别  "
"``map`` 至  ``0`` 。"

msgid ""
"This example again uses the timeout to automatically alternate between zoom "
"levels 0 and 1:"
msgstr "此示例再次使用超时在缩放级别0和1之间自动切换："

msgid "Other ways to set the zoom:"
msgstr "设置缩放的其他方法："

msgid "``setView(center, zoom)`` , It also sets the center of the map"
msgstr "``setView(center, zoom)`` ，它还设置地图的中心"

msgid ""
"``flyTo(center, zoom)`` , Similar to ``setView``, but it has smooth "
"animations"
msgstr "``flyTo(center, zoom)`` ，类似于  ``setView`` ，但它有流畅的动画"

msgid ""
"``zoomIn()`` / ``zoomIn(delta)`` , Zoom in to the ``delta`` zoom level with "
"a default zoom level of ``1``"
msgstr ""
"``zoomIn()`` / ``zoomIn(delta)`` , Zoom in to the ``delta`` zoom level with "
"a default zoom level of ``1``"

msgid ""
"``zoomOut()`` / ``zoomOut(delta)`` , Reduce the ``delta`` zoom level with a "
"default zoom level of ``1``"
msgstr ""
"``zoomOut()`` / ``zoomOut(delta)`` , Reduce the ``delta`` zoom level with a "
"default zoom level of ``1``"

msgid ""
"``setZoomAround(fixedPoint, zoom)`` , Set the ``delta`` level while "
"maintaining a fixed point (scroll mouse wheel zoom)"
msgstr ""
"``setZoomAround(fixedPoint, zoom)`` ，设置  ``delta`` 在保持固定点的同时保持水平(滚动鼠标滚轮缩放)"

msgid ""
"``fitBounds(bounds)`` ,Automatically calculate scaling to match rectangular "
"areas on the map"
msgstr "``fitBounds(bounds)`` ，自动计算比例以匹配地图上的矩形区域"

msgid "Fractional scaling"
msgstr "分数尺度"

msgid ""
"Fractional scaling is a new concept proposed in Leaflet 1.0.0. Prior to "
"this, the map’s zoom level can only be an integer (0, 1, 2, etc.), but "
"scores like 1.5 or 1.25 can now be used."
msgstr ""
"分数尺度是在传单1.0.0中提出的一个新概念。在此之前，地图的缩放级别只能是整数(0、1、2等)，但现在可以使用1.5或1.25这样的分数。"

msgid ""
"Fractional scaling is disabled by default. To enable it, use the MAP’s "
"``zoomSnap`` option. The default value for the ``zoomSnap`` option is 1 "
"(which means the zoom level of the map can be 0, 1, 2, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下禁用分数缩放。要启用它，请使用地图的  ``zoomSnap`` 选择。的缺省值  ``zoomSnap`` "
"选项为1(这意味着地图的缩放级别可以是0、1、2等)。"

msgid ""
"If you set the value of ``zoomSnap`` to ``0.5``, the effective zoom level "
"for the map will be ``1``, ``1.5``, ``2``, etc."
msgstr ""
"如果您将  ``zoomSnap`` 至  ``0.5`` ，地图的有效缩放级别将为  ``1`` ，  ``1.5`` ，  ``2`` 等"

msgid ""
"If the setting is ``0.1``, the effective zoom level for the map will be "
"``0``, ``0.1``, ``0.2``, ``0.3``, ``0.4``, etc."
msgstr ""
"如果设置为  ``0.1`` ，地图的有效缩放级别将为  ``0`` ，  ``0.1`` ，  ``0.2`` ，  ``0.3`` ，  "
"``0.4`` 等"

msgid "The following example uses the ``zoomSnap`` value as ``0.25``:"
msgstr "下面的示例使用  ``zoomSnap`` 价值为  ``0.25`` ："

msgid ""
"As you can see, Leaflet only loads tiles with a zoom level of ``0`` or ``1``"
" and Need to scale them."
msgstr "如您所见，Leaplet仅加载缩放级别为  ``0`` 或  ``1`` 并需要对其进行扩展。"

msgid ""
"The Leaflet will zoom to the most recent one. For example, if you have "
"``zoomSnap: 0.25``, you try to do ``map.setZoom(0.8)`` and the zoom will "
"return To 0.75."
msgstr ""
"传单将缩放到最新的传单。例如，如果您有  ``zoomSnap: 0.25`` ，你试着去做  ``map.setZoom(0.8)`` "
"而变焦将回到0.75。"

msgid ""
"There is another important map option related to ``zoomSnap``: ``zoomDelta``"
" option. It controls the zoom level of the image when using the zoom button "
"(from the default ``L.Control.Zoom``) or the +/- keys on the keyboard."
msgstr ""
"还有另一个重要的地图选项与  ``zoomSnap`` ：  ``zoomDelta`` 选择。它控制使用缩放按钮时图像的缩放级别(默认设置  "
"``L.Control.Zoom`` )或键盘上的+/-键。"

msgid ""
"For scrolling mouse wheel zoom, the ``wheelPxPerZoomLevel`` option controls "
"the zoom speed of the mouse wheel."
msgstr "对于滚动的鼠标滚轮缩放，  ``wheelPxPerZoomLevel`` 选项控制鼠标滚轮的缩放速度。"

msgid "Here’s an example where ``zoomSnap`` is set to zero:"
msgstr "下面是一个例子，其中  ``zoomSnap`` 设置为零："

msgid "Try the following to see how the zoom level changes:"
msgstr "尝试以下操作以查看缩放级别如何更改："

msgid "If you have a touch screen, please pinch the zoom"
msgstr "如果您有触摸屏，请按下变焦"

msgid "Zoom with the mouse wheel"
msgstr "使用鼠标滚轮进行缩放"

msgid ""
"Make a box zoom (hold the ``shift`` key on the keyboard while dragging the "
"mouse)"
msgstr "进行框缩放(按住  ``shift`` 在键盘上按键，同时拖动鼠标)"

msgid "Use the zoom button"
msgstr "使用缩放按钮"

msgid "This tutorial is over. Now show your zoom level on the map!"
msgstr "本教程到此结束。现在在地图上显示您的缩放级别！"

msgid "Use WMS with TMS services"
msgstr "将WMS与TMS服务一起使用"

msgid ""
"WMS is an abbreviation for **web map service** , a popular way for "
"professional GIS software to publish maps (rarely used by non-GIS "
"personnel)."
msgstr ""
"WMS是WMS的缩写 **web map service** ，这是专业的地理信息系统软件发布地图的流行方式(非地理信息系统人员很少使用)。"

msgid "TMS stands for **tiled map service** ( **tile map service** )."
msgstr "TMS代表 **tiled map service** ( **tile map service** )。"

msgid "WMS in Leaflet"
msgstr "宣传单中的WMS"

msgid ""
"When someone publishes a WMS service, the most likely link is to the "
"``GetCapabilities`` document. In this tutorial, we will use the demo map "
"service from GeoServer at https://demo.boundlessgeo.com/geoserver/web/. We "
"will use GeoServer’s demo map service at "
"https://demo.boundlessgeo.com/geoserver/web/. As you can see on this page, "
"“WMS” links to the following URL:"
msgstr ""
"当某人发布WMS服务时，最有可能的链接是指向  ``GetCapabilities`` "
"文件。在本教程中，我们将使用位于https://demo.boundlessgeo.com/geoserver/web/.的Geoserver的演示地图服务我们将在https://demo.boundlessgeo.com/geoserver/web/.上使用Geoserver的演示地图服务正如您在此页面上看到的，“wms”链接到以下URL："

msgid ""
"Leaflet cannot parse WMS’s ``GetCapabilities`` document. So you have to "
"create a ``L.TileLayer.WMS`` layer, which is used to provide a basic WMS "
"link and specify any WMS options you need."
msgstr ""
"单张无法解析WMS的  ``GetCapabilities`` 文件。因此您必须创建一个  ``L.TileLayer.WMS`` "
"层，用于提供基本的WMS链接并指定所需的任何WMS选项。"

msgid ""
"The basic WMS link is just a ``GetCapabilities`` link with no parameters, "
"for example:"
msgstr "基本的WMS链接只是  ``GetCapabilities`` 不带参数的链接，例如："

msgid "The way to use this in Leaflet’s map is simple:"
msgstr "在宣传单的地图上使用这一点的方法很简单："

msgid ""
"An instance of ``L.TileLayer.WMS`` requires at least one option: ``layers``."
" Note that the “layer” concept in Leaflet is not the same as the “layer” "
"concept in WMS!"
msgstr ""
"的一个实例  ``L.TileLayer.WMS`` 至少需要一个选项：  ``layers`` "
"。请注意，宣传单中的“层”概念与WMS中的“层”概念不同！"

msgid ""
"The WMS server will define **a set of layers** in the ``GetCapabilities`` "
"XML document, but the document is mostly lengthy and difficult to "
"understand, so it is usually used like QGIS. Software to view information "
"about available layers in the WMS server:"
msgstr ""
"WMS服务器将定义 **a set of layers** 在  ``GetCapabilities`` "
"XML文档，但该文档大多较长且难于理解，因此通常像QGIS一样使用。用于查看WMS服务器中可用层信息的软件："

msgid ""
"We can see that OpenGeo demonstrates WMS with a WMS layer named ``ne:ne`` "
"with a base map. Let’s see what it looks like:"
msgstr "我们可以看到OpenGeo使用名为的WMS图层演示了WMS  ``ne:ne`` 有一张底图。让我们来看看它是什么样子："

msgid ""
"Note that the Mapfile used above needs to define the output projection as "
"``EPSG:3857``."
msgstr "请注意，上面使用的 Mapfile 需要将输出投影定义为  ``EPSG:3857`` 。"

msgid ""
"It is also important to note that if the Mapfile is not properly configured,"
" it is possible that the MapServer map (the full map by default) will be "
"used as a slice to form an overlay."
msgstr "还需要注意的是，如果没有正确配置映射文件，则可能会将MapServer映射(默认情况下为完整映射)用作切片以形成覆盖。"

msgid "Or we can try the WMS layer of ``nasa:bluemarble``:"
msgstr "或者我们可以尝试WMS层  ``nasa:bluemarble`` ："

msgid ""
"The ``layers`` option is a comma-separated list of layers. If the WMS "
"service defines multiple layers, the map can introduce multiple layers to "
"create images at the same time."
msgstr "这个  ``layers`` 选项是逗号分隔的层列表。如果WMS服务定义了多个层，则地图可以引入多个层来同时创建图像。"

msgid ""
"For example, on the WMS server we are using, there is a "
"``ne:ne_10m_admin_0_countries`` layer displays the country’s terrestrial and"
" country names. There is also a ``ne:ne_10m_admin_0_boundary_lines_land`` "
"layer shows country borders. If we request two layers at the same time, the "
"WMS server will combine the two layers into one image and separate them with"
" a comma:"
msgstr ""
"例如，在我们使用的WMS服务器上，有一个  ``ne:ne_10m_admin_0_countries`` Layer显示国家的陆地和国家名称。还有一个"
"  ``ne:ne_10m_admin_0_boundary_lines_land`` "
"图层显示国家/地区边界。如果我们同时请求两个层，WMS服务器会将两个层合并为一个图像，并用逗号分隔它们："

msgid ""
"Note that this will request an image from the WMS server that is different "
"from the ``L.TileLayer.WMS`` created for the country and country boundaries,"
" which will both Add to the map. In the first case, an image request is made"
" and then the WMS server decides how to combine the images. In the second "
"case, two image requests are made, and then the Leaflet code running in the "
"web browser determines how the images are combined."
msgstr ""
"请注意，这将从WMS服务器请求不同于  ``L.TileLayer.WMS`` "
"为国家和国家边界创建，这两个都将添加到地图中。在第一种情况下，发出图像请求，然后WMS服务器决定如何组合图像。在第二种情况下，发出两个图像请求，然后在Web浏览器中运行的传单代码确定如何组合图像。"

msgid ""
"If we combine these with layer controls, we can create a simple map to see "
"the differences:"
msgstr "如果我们将这些与Layer控件相结合，我们可以创建一个简单的地图来查看差异："

msgid ""
"Change to \"Countries, then The boundaries option, so you can see the "
"borders of the land, and the WMS server is smart enough to display the "
"building tags on the map. When multiple layers are requested, how to combine"
" the layers depends on the WMS server."
msgstr ""
"更改为“国家，然后是边界选项，这样您就可以看到土地的边界，并且WMS服务器足够智能，可以在地图上显示建筑标签。当请求多个层时，如何合并这些层取决于WMS服务器。"

msgid "Information for GIS users of WMS services"
msgstr "面向WMS服务的GIS用户的信息"

msgid ""
"From a GIS perspective, Leaflet’s WMS processing is very basic. It does not "
"support ``GetCapabilities``, does not support legend, and does not support "
"``GetFeatureInfo``."
msgstr ""
"从地理信息系统的角度来看，传单的WMS处理是非常基本的。它不支持  ``GetCapabilities`` ，不支持图例，也不支持  "
"``GetFeatureInfo`` 。"

msgid ""
"We can do this in the Leaflet’s API Found in the documentation documentation"
" Additional options for ``L.TileLayer.WMS``. Any option can be passed to the"
" WMS server via a link to ``getImage``."
msgstr ""
"我们可以在文档文档中找到的单张的API中执行此操作  ``L.TileLayer.WMS`` 。任何选项都可以通过链接传递到WMS服务器  "
"``getImage`` 。"

msgid ""
"Also note that Leaflet supports very few coordinate systems: ``CRS:3857``, "
"``CRS:3395`` And ``CRS:4326`` (see the ``L.CRS`` documentation). If your WMS"
" service is unable to provide images in these coordinate systems, you may "
"need to create additional coordinate systems in Leaflet using Proj4Leaflet ."
" In addition, to use the correct CRS when initializing your map, add it to "
"any WMS layer:"
msgstr ""
"另请注意，LEAFLE支持的坐标系很少：  ``CRS:3857`` ，  ``CRS:3395`` 和  ``CRS:4326`` (请参阅  "
"``L.CRS`` "
"文档)。如果您的WMS服务无法在这些坐标系中提供图像，您可能需要使用Proj4Leaflet在LEAFLE中创建其他坐标系。此外，要在初始化地图时使用正确的CRS，请将其添加到任何WMS图层："

msgid "TMS in Leaflet"
msgstr "单张中的TMS"

msgid ""
"Although Leaflet does not explicitly support the TMS service, the naming "
"rules for tiles are very similar to the naming rules for ``L.TileLayer``, so"
" the TMS service will not be described here."
msgstr ""
"尽管LEAFLE不明确支持TMS服务，但切片的命名规则与的命名规则非常相似  ``L.TileLayer`` ，因此TMS服务将不在此描述。"

msgid "Using the same OpenGeo WMS/TMS server demo, we can see a TMS endpoint:"
msgstr "使用相同的OpenGeo WMS/TMS服务器演示，我们可以看到TMS端点："

msgid ""
"Check MapCache help about TMS And TMS specification , You can see the links "
"to the map tiles in TMS as follows:"
msgstr "查看有关TMS和TMS规范的MapCache帮助，您可以看到TMS中地图切片的链接，如下所示："

msgid ""
"Using OpenGeo’s TMS service as ``L.TileLayer``, we can check the function "
"documentation to see which ``tileset`` is available and builds our basic "
"link:"
msgstr ""
"使用OpenGeo的TMS服务作为  ``L.TileLayer`` ，我们可以查看函数文档以了解哪些  ``tileset`` "
"是可用的，并建立了我们的基本链接："

msgid "Use the ``tms:true`` option when instantiating a layer as follows:"
msgstr "使用  ``tms:true`` 选项实例化一个层，如下所示："

msgid ""
"A new feature of **Leaflet 1.0** is the ability to use ``{-y}`` instead of "
"``tms: true`` options, for example:"
msgstr "的一个新功能 **Leaflet 1.0** 是一种使用  ``{-y}`` 而不是  ``tms: true`` 选项，例如："

msgid ""
"``tms: true`` option (Leaflet 0.7) or ``{-y}`` (Leaflet 1.0) is necessary "
"because the origin of the coordinates of ``L.TileLayer`` is usually in the "
"upper left corner, so the Y coordinate is lowered. In TMS, the coordinate "
"origin is in the lower left corner, so the Y coordinate **rises**."
msgstr ""
"``tms: true`` 备选方案(单张0.7)或  ``{-y}`` (小叶1.0)是必要的，因为  ``L.TileLayer`` "
"通常位于左上角，因此Y坐标较低。在TMS中，坐标原点位于左下角，因此Y坐标 **rises** 。"

msgid ""
"In addition to the differences in ``y`` coordinates and the discovery of "
"tiles, the TMS service also provides accurate services in the form of "
"``L.TileLayer``."
msgstr "除了两国之间的差异  ``y`` 对于坐标和切片的发现，TMS服务还以  ``L.TileLayer`` 。"

msgid "Use the map panes"
msgstr "使用地图窗格"

msgid ""
"In Leaflet, map panes can automatically group layers, but developers are not"
" aware that this allows browsers to process multiple layers more "
"efficiently, rather than processing one layer at a time."
msgstr "在LEAFLE中，地图窗格可以自动对层进行分组，但开发人员没有意识到这可以让浏览器更有效地处理多个层，而不是一次处理一个层。"

msgid ""
"Map panes uses z-index CSS property Properties to control some layers to "
"appear on top of other layers. The default order is as follows:"
msgstr "地图窗格使用z索引的css属性属性来控制某些层显示在其他层的顶部。默认顺序如下："

msgid "``TileLayer`` s and ``GridLayer`` s"
msgstr "``TileLayer`` S和  ``GridLayer`` S"

msgid "``Path`` s, like lines, polylines, circles, or ``GeoJSON`` layers."
msgstr "``Path`` S，喜欢直线，多段线，圆，或者  ``GeoJSON`` 层次感。"

msgid "``Marker`` shadows"
msgstr "``Marker`` 阴影"

msgid "``Marker`` icons"
msgstr "``Marker`` 图标"

msgid "``Popup`` s"
msgstr "``Popup`` S"

msgid ""
"That’s why in the Leaflet map, popups are displayed on top of other layers, "
"markers are always displayed on the slice layer, and so on."
msgstr "这就是为什么在传单地图中，弹出窗口显示在其他层的顶部，标记始终显示在切片层上，依此类推。"

msgid ""
"Leaflet 1.0.0 has added a new feature (0.7.X not available) to customize the"
" map panes to adjust the default order."
msgstr "小册子1.0.0添加了一项新功能(0.7.X不可用)，以自定义地图窗格以调整默认顺序。"

msgid "Default value is not always appropriate"
msgstr "缺省值并不总是合适的"

msgid ""
"In some special cases, the default layer sorting is not always appropriate. "
"We use the following basemap and an example of a label layer to explain:"
msgstr "在某些特殊情况下，默认的层排序并不总是合适的。我们使用以下底图和标签图层的示例进行说明："

msgid ""
"If we add the above basemap and annotation layer to the Leaflet map, any "
"polygons or markers will appear above the two layers, but it might be better"
" to have the annotation layer appear on top. How should we achieve this?"
msgstr ""
"如果我们将上面的底图和注释层添加到小叶地图，任何多边形或标记都将显示在这两个层的上方，但让注释层显示在顶部可能会更好。我们应该如何实现这一点？"

msgid "Custom panes"
msgstr "自定义窗格"

msgid ""
"For basemaps and overlay layers like GeoJSON, we can use their default "
"settings, but for annotation layers we need to customize a pane so that it "
"appears on top of the GeoJSON layer."
msgstr "对于底图和覆盖层(如GeoJSON)，我们可以使用它们的默认设置，但对于注释层，我们需要自定义一个窗格，使其显示在GeoJSON层的顶部。"

msgid ""
"Custom map panes are created on top of the original map, so we should first "
"create a map instance of ``L.Map`` and the panes it needs:"
msgstr "自定义地图窗格是在原始地图的基础上创建的，因此我们应该首先创建  ``L.Map`` 以及它所需的面板："

msgid ""
"The next step is to set the value of the pane’s z-index. To view the default"
" values for the pane, set the new pane’s z-index value to 650 to have the "
"label layer appear below the popups layer above the markers layer. Use the "
"``getPane()`` method to get the Html element of the pane and then modify its"
" z-index value."
msgstr ""
"下一步是设置面板的z索引值。要查看该窗格的默认值，请将新窗格的z索引值设置为650，以使Label层显示在Markers层上方的Popup层的下方。使用"
"  ``getPane()`` 方法来获取该窗格的HTML元素，然后修改其z索引值。"

msgid ""
"One of the problems with having the image layer on top of other layers is "
"that the slice captures events such as clicks or touches. If the user clicks"
" on an area of the map, the browser will think that the user is clicking on "
"the image layer instead of the GeoJSON layer or the markup layer. We can use"
" CSS’s pointer-events property to solve this problem:"
msgstr ""
"将图像层放在其他层之上的问题之一是，切片会捕获点击或触摸等事件。如果用户点击地图的某个区域，浏览器会认为用户点击的是图像层，而不是GeoJSON层或标记层。我们可以使用CSS的指针事件属性来解决这个问题："

msgid ""
"The new pane has been created, we can add the layer, pay attention to the "
"``pane`` option on the label layer:"
msgstr "新的面板已经创建，我们可以添加层，请注意  ``pane`` 标签层上的选项："

msgid "Finally, add some interactive features to the GeoJSON layer:"
msgstr "最后，向GeoJSON层添加一些交互功能："

msgid "This way the example map is complete!"
msgstr "这样，示例地图就完整了！"
